WEBVTT

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:14.112
When you're ready, Son of Adam.

00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:24.712
Yah!

00:00:49.832 --> 00:00:52.672
Come on, humans!
While we're still young.

00:00:54.272 --> 00:00:57.072
If he tells us to hurry one more time,

00:00:57.232 --> 00:01:00.352
I'm gonna turn him into a big, fluffy hat.

00:01:01.072 --> 00:01:03.072
Hurry up! Come on!

00:01:03.232 --> 00:01:06.592
-He is getting a little bossy.
-No! Behind you! It's her!

00:01:06.752 --> 00:01:08.832
-Run! Run!
-Run!

00:01:34.192 --> 00:01:35.472
Hurry!

00:01:38.552 --> 00:01:40.032
Inside!

00:01:40.192 --> 00:01:41.712
Dive! Dive!

00:01:44.672 --> 00:01:46.832
Quick! Quick, quick, quick!

00:01:53.672 --> 00:01:55.552
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

00:02:03.432 --> 00:02:04.432
(WHIMPERS)

00:02:15.152 --> 00:02:17.472
Maybe she's gone.

00:02:18.632 --> 00:02:20.672
-I suppose I'll go look.
-No!

00:02:20.832 --> 00:02:23.312
You're worth nothing to Narnia dead.

00:02:23.512 --> 00:02:25.672
Well, neither are you, Beaver.

00:02:25.832 --> 00:02:27.592
Thanks, sweetheart.

00:02:36.432 --> 00:02:38.312
What's that? What's...

00:02:38.472 --> 00:02:39.792
(SHUSHING)

00:02:43.152 --> 00:02:44.352
Come out! Come out!

00:02:44.512 --> 00:02:45.552
I hope you've all been good

00:02:45.712 --> 00:02:48.352
'cause there's someone here
to see you!

00:03:02.312 --> 00:03:05.112
(LAUGHING)

00:03:09.792 --> 00:03:11.672
Merry Christmas, sir.

00:03:11.832 --> 00:03:15.592
It certainly is, Lucy,
since you have arrived.

00:03:16.152 --> 00:03:19.832
Look, I've put up with a lot
since I got here, but this...

00:03:20.032 --> 00:03:23.272
-We thought you were the Witch.
-Yes, yes, I'm sorry about that,

00:03:23.432 --> 00:03:29.232
but in my defence, I have been driving
one of these longer than the Witch.

00:03:29.392 --> 00:03:32.032
I thought there was
no Christmas in Narnia.

00:03:32.192 --> 00:03:34.752
No. Not for a long time.

00:03:35.432 --> 00:03:39.072
But the hope that you have brought,
Your Majesties,

00:03:39.232 --> 00:03:42.312
is finally starting
to weaken the Witch's power.

00:03:43.672 --> 00:03:47.032
Still, I dare say
you could do with these.

00:03:49.952 --> 00:03:50.952
(LAUGHING)

00:03:51.112 --> 00:03:52.512
Presents!

00:03:58.832 --> 00:04:01.232
The juice of the fire-flower.

00:04:01.392 --> 00:04:04.232
One drop will cure any injury.

00:04:07.032 --> 00:04:09.992
And though I hope
you never have to use it.

00:04:12.672 --> 00:04:13.912
Thank you, sir,

00:04:14.072 --> 00:04:17.472
but I think I could be brave enough.

00:04:18.192 --> 00:04:19.992
I'm sure you could.

00:04:20.712 --> 00:04:23.632
But battles are ugly affairs.

00:04:31.032 --> 00:04:32.312
Susan.

00:04:35.232 --> 00:04:39.192
Trust in this bow
and it will not easily miss.

00:04:41.272 --> 00:04:44.232
What happened
to "battles are ugly affairs"?

00:04:44.392 --> 00:04:45.552
(CHUCKLING)

00:04:46.272 --> 00:04:49.392
Though you don't seem to have
a problem making yourself heard,

00:04:49.552 --> 00:04:52.392
blow on this and wherever you are,

00:04:53.712 --> 00:04:55.552
help will come.

00:04:56.752 --> 00:04:58.072
Thanks.

00:04:59.032 --> 00:05:00.272
Peter.

00:05:02.352 --> 00:05:05.512
The time to use these
may be near at hand.

00:05:13.792 --> 00:05:15.432
Thank you, sir.

00:05:15.752 --> 00:05:18.992
These are tools, not toys.

00:05:19.792 --> 00:05:21.952
Bear them well and wisely.

00:05:23.672 --> 00:05:26.472
Now, I must be off.

00:05:26.632 --> 00:05:28.992
Winter is almost over,

00:05:29.152 --> 00:05:33.312
and things do pile up when
you've been gone a hundred years.

00:05:36.912 --> 00:05:39.072
Long live Aslan!

00:05:41.432 --> 00:05:43.232
And Merry Christmas!

00:05:45.952 --> 00:05:48.512
-Merry Christmas!
-Merry Christmas!

00:05:48.672 --> 00:05:51.112
PETER: See you next year!
LUCY: Goodbye!

00:05:52.472 --> 00:05:54.512
Told you he was real.

00:05:54.672 --> 00:05:58.392
He said winter was almost over.

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:01.632
You know what that means.

00:06:02.952 --> 00:06:04.472
No more ice.

00:06:15.552 --> 00:06:18.352
-We need to cross, now!
-Don't beavers make dams?

00:06:18.512 --> 00:06:21.072
-I'm not that fast, dear.
-PETER: Come on!

00:06:21.232 --> 00:06:23.112
Wait! Will you think
about this for a minute?

00:06:23.272 --> 00:06:26.072
-We don't have a minute.
-I'm just trying to be realistic.

00:06:26.232 --> 00:06:29.752
No, you're trying to be smart. As usual.

00:06:31.672 --> 00:06:33.552
(WOLF HOWLING)

